{"threads":[{"id":"thread_1","facts":[{"id":"fact_1","kind":"want","text":"Find the treasure marked on the party's map.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_new_1","kind":"could_use","text":"Grimny's ghost said the map is Bral's map of the seven dwarves' mine hoard. He said Bral probably hid the hoard in the cave marked Dragon's Lair.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_2"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_74","beat_75","beat_77"]},{"id":"fact_new_2","kind":"could_use","text":"Dr. Uriah's Read Languages spell lets him read the writing under one location on the treasure map per day.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_19"]},{"id":"fact_new_3","kind":"unknown","text":"What is the map's one remaining unidentified location? Sir Phidipaldi guesses it is King Hogboon's, whose goblins live in the temple ruins on the way to the mine.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_22","beat_67"]}]},{"id":"thread_2","facts":[{"id":"fact_2","kind":"want","text":"Kill the dragon near Brandonsford for Eric the Reeve's 1000 gold bounty.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_3","kind":"blocked_by","text":"George says nothing pierces the black dragon's scales; arrows and swords have all failed against them.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_4","kind":"threat","text":"George says the black dragon will soon fly and doom Brandonsford.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_5","kind":"could_use","text":"Lady Hilda will join the party against the dragon if they pay her.","state":"ended","change":"ended","ended_how":"used up: Lady Hilda joined the party, hired with Cedric's promissory note","learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":"thread_12","also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior","beat_64"]},{"id":"fact_6","kind":"could_use","text":"Warwick keeps a magical mithril chain shirt; Dunk says it could help against the dragon.","state":"ended","change":"ended","ended_how":"used up: Warwick lent the shirt under the Warwick deal","learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":"thread_13","also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior","beat_36","beat_37"]},{"id":"fact_7","kind":"unknown","text":"Where did the new dragon near Brandonsford come from?","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_new_4","kind":"could_use","text":"The party's map marks the Dragon's lair. Grimny says that cave is very small, just one big room, and was empty and unvisited when the dwarves scouted it.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_1"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_20","beat_77"]},{"id":"fact_new_5","kind":"unknown","text":"Is there really a dragon? Dunk suspects Bral is only pretending there is one to keep everybody away.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_16"],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_77","beat_78"]},{"id":"fact_new_6","kind":"could_use","text":"The party has enough faun wine. Vivian says that if the dragon drank enough of it, it would be knocked out and they could drag the sword through its mouth as Sir Brandon did.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_49","beat_50","beat_65"]},{"id":"fact_new_7","kind":"could_use","text":"Sir Phidipaldi's plan is to dose caught game with faun wine and leave it outside the dragon's cave. Once the dragon eats it, the party goes in.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_52"]},{"id":"fact_new_8","kind":"could_use","text":"The party holds Sir Brandon's sword, a magic sword especially effective against evil beings.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_4"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_3","beat_18"]},{"id":"fact_new_9","kind":"could_use","text":"The wizard Malzazarik and Lady Hilda have joined the party against the dragon.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_64"]},{"id":"fact_new_10","kind":"could_use","text":"Vivian says the church knows the tale of Sir Brandon's dragon slaying. She adds that what he really did is hard to tell, since only he told it.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_51","beat_55"]}]},{"id":"thread_3","facts":[{"id":"fact_8","kind":"want","text":"Clear the evil out of the Barrow Mound for the Free Goblin Society.","state":"ended","change":"ended","ended_how":"replaced: Wayman changed the deal so the goblins keep the upper mound and wall off the stairs","learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior","beat_13","beat_15"]},{"id":"fact_9","kind":"blocked_by","text":"A huge undead with a greatsword in the Barrow Mound stands in the way (see thread_4).","state":"ended","change":"ended","ended_how":"no longer relevant: the deal to clear the mound was replaced","learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":"thread_4","also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior","beat_15"]},{"id":"fact_new_11","kind":"owe","text":"Wayman Tisdale promised Snurk never to tell King Hogboon where the Free Goblin Society goblins are.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":false,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["beat_17"]}]},{"id":"thread_4","facts":[{"id":"fact_10","kind":"threat","text":"Sir Alfred lies incapacitated but not destroyed in Sir Brandon's tomb below the Barrow Mound, and may attack the party if they return.","state":"open","change":"updated","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior","beat_1","beat_11"]},{"id":"fact_11","kind":"threat","text":"Sir Alfred may recover and kill more Free Goblin Society members, who are walling off the stairs to contain him.","state":"open","change":"updated","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_3"],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior","beat_13","beat_15"]},{"id":"fact_12","kind":"unknown","text":"Why does Sir Alfred, the huge undead knight with a greatsword, roam the Barrow Mound?","state":"open","change":"updated","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior","beat_1"]},{"id":"fact_new_12","kind":"unknown","text":"Why does Brother Dirk regard the undead Sir Alfred as holy?","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_10"]}]},{"id":"thread_5","facts":[{"id":"fact_13","kind":"unknown","text":"Cedric and Warwick say supplies and metal stopped reaching Brandonsford when the dragon troubles began. What exactly is stopping the shipments?","state":"open","change":"updated","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior","beat_26","beat_29"]}]},{"id":"thread_6","facts":[{"id":"fact_14","kind":"unknown","text":"Why are hidden fairies coming out more often along with the dragon?","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior"]}]},{"id":"thread_7","facts":[{"id":"fact_15","kind":"unknown","text":"Who does the noblewoman statue in the Barrow Mound depict?","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"low","evidence":["prior"]}]},{"id":"thread_8","facts":[{"id":"fact_16","kind":"owe","text":"Dunk must help Ingrid get into Warwick's house and give Warwick the sleeping potion.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":true,"possibly_moot":"Sir Phidipaldi told Ingrid that Warwick knows of her visits and is not interested, and she left crestfallen (beat_61, beat_62); Dunk was never released","certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior","beat_61","beat_62"]}]},{"id":"thread_9","facts":[{"id":"fact_17","kind":"owe","text":"Dr. Uriah must do penance at the Barrow Mound for Father William.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":true,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior"]},{"id":"fact_18","kind":"owe","text":"Dr. Uriah must give Father William a 10 gold donation for the Barrow Mound's upkeep.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":true,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"high","evidence":["prior"]}]},{"id":"thread_10","facts":[{"id":"fact_19","kind":"owe","text":"The party must let Squints pick second from the first treasure, after the elite members.","state":"open","change":"carried","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":true,"possibly_moot":"The barrow treasure was signed over to Cedric for a promissory note (beat_18, beat_28) with no sign Squints picked; Squints never released the party","certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"medium","evidence":["prior","beat_28"]}]},{"id":"thread_11","facts":[{"id":"fact_new_13","kind":"owe","text":"Dr. Uriah must return the holy robes from the barrow to Brother Dirk's church once the dragon is defeated. Witch powder showed the robes are a religious relic, not magical.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":true,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["beat_23","beat_25","beat_41"]}]},{"id":"thread_12","facts":[{"id":"fact_new_14","kind":"could_use","text":"Cedric's signed promissory note owes the party 975 gold for their barrow treasure. It is payable only once the caravans flow again.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_5"],"importance":"high","actionability":"low","evidence":["beat_27","beat_28"]},{"id":"fact_new_15","kind":"owe","text":"The party used Cedric's 975 gold promissory note to recruit Malzazarik and Lady Hilda, and owes them payment from it.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":true,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"uncertain","uncertain_reason":"The terms of how the note pays the recruits were not stated","about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_2"],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["beat_30","beat_64"]}]},{"id":"thread_13","facts":[{"id":"fact_new_16","kind":"owe","text":"The party must bring Warwick metal from the Dwarven mine to the north. Warwick keeps Sir Phidipaldi's lyre meanwhile.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":true,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_35","beat_36"]},{"id":"fact_new_17","kind":"owe","text":"The party must return Warwick's mithril chain shirt, his grandfather's armor. Warwick holds the party's plate armor as collateral.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":true,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_36","beat_60"]},{"id":"fact_new_18","kind":"could_use","text":"Wayman Tisdale wears Warwick's mithril chain shirt, on loan. It greatly improves his protection and halves damage from magic weapons and spells.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_2"],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_37"]},{"id":"fact_new_19","kind":"blocked_by","text":"A natural-looking cave-in seals the Dwarven mine entrance and blocks getting the metal. It can be dug through, and Dunk has started breaking into it.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"high","evidence":["beat_69","beat_70"]}]},{"id":"thread_14","facts":[{"id":"fact_new_20","kind":"want","text":"Obtain protection against the dragon's poison.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["beat_38"]},{"id":"fact_new_21","kind":"blocked_by","text":"No source of a poison remedy is known. Ingrid says it is beyond her, and Vivian privately admitted she cannot make one and knows only three herbs.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"low","evidence":["beat_43","beat_53"]}]},{"id":"thread_16","facts":[{"id":"fact_new_22","kind":"unknown","text":"Did Bral, the greediest of the seven dwarf brothers, kill Grimny, as Grimny's ghost believes?","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"high","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_73"]},{"id":"fact_new_23","kind":"unknown","text":"What became of the other dwarf brothers Grelli, Durney, Brenny, Tedry, Rooney and Bral, and where is Bral now?","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":["thread_2"],"importance":"medium","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_69","beat_70","beat_73"]}]},{"id":"thread_17","facts":[{"id":"fact_new_24","kind":"unknown","text":"Is the uninscribed magical ring Dunk took from the dead dwarf, which he felt a growing urge to put on, cursed?","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_71","beat_72"]},{"id":"fact_new_25","kind":"could_use","text":"Dunk wears the dead dwarf's magical ring; wearing it let him see and speak with Grimny's ghost.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":false,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_72","beat_79"]}]}]}